{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>Until if I have spoken.</b> Here אִם serves in the sense of אֲשֶׁר and in the sense of כִּי, as in ״עַד כִּי יָבֹא שִׁילֹה״ (Genesis 49). And this is what the Sages said: כִּי serves in four senses, and one of them is אִי — and that is אִם."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:00:14.232468718Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}